        <mxCell id="note_128" value="&lt;b&gt;Validation Record is created only when Operator validates.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9db0c7&quot;&gt;If Architect identifies repair from Implementer Report before validation, do not create a Validation Record. Capture that as report-review outcome or repair-card context.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=12;spacing=10;fillColor=#21180b;strokeColor=#765f12;fontColor=#f1f7ff;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="1" vertex="1">
